Where to?

00:43:16.600 --> 00:43:18.860
Angelus Lens Company, 1911 West Washington.

00:43:20.010 --> 00:43:21.810
This is the factory that grinds Brilla's lenses.

00:43:21.970 --> 00:43:23.450
They ought to have a copy of Stone's prescription.

00:43:24.010 --> 00:43:24.530
You hope.

00:43:25.270 --> 00:43:28.120
Well, you bet I hope. Just about our last chance.

00:43:30.120 --> 00:43:31.760
Maybe another visit to the Dyson plant.

00:43:32.100 --> 00:43:33.620
Well, what more can you find out there?

00:43:34.400 --> 00:43:37.430
Probably nothing, so we can get the night watchman

00:43:37.430 --> 00:43:39.300
to tell us if there's been any action around there

00:43:39.300 --> 00:43:42.530
after closing time, any unusual activities.

00:43:42.890 --> 00:43:50.020
Too late, they're closed.

00:43:51.020 --> 00:43:52.440
Well, here's where I had Bergs and read

00:43:52.440 --> 00:43:53.320
of my other accomplishments.

00:43:54.560 --> 00:43:57.240
No, no, honey, no use missing your neck anyway.

00:43:57.380 --> 00:43:58.540
It'll be easy with just one of us.

00:43:59.020 --> 00:43:59.760
OK, I'll wait.

00:44:00.280 --> 00:44:01.080
No, better still.

00:44:01.370 --> 00:44:04.070
I'll go down to the Dyson plant and see that night watchman for you.

00:44:04.190 --> 00:44:06.050
Nothing doing. I don't want you going down there alone.

00:44:06.550 --> 00:44:07.370
