00:44:11.210 --> 00:44:13.340
What if you do find that prescription? Then what?

00:44:14.040 --> 00:44:16.840
Well, if it's what I think it is, I'll go back to the Dyson house and have it out with them.

00:44:18.460 --> 00:44:20.860
Hey, wait a minute. Haven't you forgotten something?

00:44:24.680 --> 00:44:25.600
Thank you, Mr. Nolan.

00:46:25.280 --> 00:46:26.980
Now, ain't this something for the book?

00:46:27.440 --> 00:46:29.960
Rub in a place full of little pieces of glass with...

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:32.020
The bank of Los Angeles is only two blocks away.

00:46:32.670 --> 00:46:35.170
