00:46:35.660 --> 00:46:37.860
Sure, now, Mr. Watchman, there's no robbery at all.

00:46:38.430 --> 00:46:40.030
There's only a little prescription I'm after.

00:46:40.510 --> 00:46:41.850
Oh, a prescription, is it?

00:46:42.010 --> 00:46:43.450
You should have broken into a drugstore.

00:46:44.150 --> 00:46:44.910
Look out behind you there.

00:46:44.990 --> 00:46:45.710
None of those tricks.

00:46:46.320 --> 00:46:47.780
That one went out with horse cars.

00:46:48.660 --> 00:46:50.920
Sure, and I've caught much smarter crooks

00:46:50.920 --> 00:46:52.340
