00:46:52.830 --> 00:46:54.270
Wait a minute, I'll prove to you I'm no crook.

00:46:54.290 --> 00:46:55.210
Stand away from that phone.

00:47:13.950 --> 00:47:15.810
Let go of me, I warn you, you better give up.

00:47:16.220 --> 00:47:16.820
Maybe you're right.

00:47:17.350 --> 00:47:18.630
Let go of me, will you?

00:47:20.310 --> 00:47:21.450
I'm telling you, you're under...

