Tracer's call.

00:47:53.560 --> 00:47:55.080
Never mind tracing the call, you don't have to.

00:47:55.610 --> 00:47:57.430
Meet me at the Dyson home, Pasadena.

00:47:57.940 --> 00:47:59.220
That's right, the meatpacking people.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:01.440
I'll have the Forden case in the bag for you.

00:48:02.480 --> 00:48:04.660
Mike, Carter, Mike!

00:48:09.800 --> 00:48:10.840
Tell him there were six of us.

00:48:11.140 --> 00:48:12.440
Get very light in the outer here

