00:49:43.500 --> 00:49:45.180
Bodyguards will be able to walk in on us any minute.

00:50:29.310 --> 00:50:29.970
Interrupted you left the back

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:32.760
What's the back door open? What's the matter with you tonight?

00:50:34.020 --> 00:50:37.580
This crazy idea of yours, business as usual, while Rome burns.

00:50:39.160 --> 00:50:42.530
You're getting jittery, Fenton. Dangerous.

00:51:11.100 --> 00:51:12.820
Yeah, I know. Nobody's home.

00:51:15.910 --> 00:51:18.230
Sorry to bust in on you like this, but I had to see you right away.

00:51:18.330 --> 00:51:20.030
Mr. Carter, we've been very lenient with you.

00:51:20.130 --> 00:51:21.610
I really don't want to have to call the police.

00:51:21.870 --> 00:51:23.330
I'm quite sure you don't want to call the police,

00:51:23.430 --> 00:51:24.790
but the police may want to call on you.

00:51:25.750 --> 00:51:28.020
Exhibit A, Alex Stone. Recognize the name?

00:51:28.160 --> 00:51:29.920
In case you forget, he's the meeting.

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:31.780
that was killed at your plant last year

00:51:31.780 --> 00:51:35.430
because he had bad eyes and accidentally walked into a hog sore.

00:51:36.360 --> 00:51:38.340
This prescription proves how bad his eyes were.

00:51:39.140 --> 00:51:41.080
20-25 vision, practically normal.

00:51:41.660 --> 00:51:42.820
So you think he was murdered?

00:51:43.060 --> 00:51:47.500
I'm afraid we're going to have to face it, Connie.

00:51:47.950 --> 00:51:48.450
Face what?

00:51:49.070 --> 00:51:51.370
Freddy thinks Fenton's been tampering with the meat,

00:51:52.370 --> 00:51:54.030
pumping water into it to add to the weight.

00:51:54.460 --> 00:51:55.200
Mm, nice racket.

00:51:55.700 --> 00:51:57.380
The difference goes into his own pocket, is that it?

00:51:57.720 --> 00:51:58.120
Exactly.

00:51:58.340 --> 00:51:59.700
Freddy thinks he could run into thousands.

00:52:00.320 --> 00:52:02.180
But murdering, he wouldn't...

00:52:03.290 --> 00:52:04.870
Just what's this guy fat in the heart?

00:52:05.180 --> 00:52:05.740
Her brother.

00:52:06.460 --> 00:52:07.520
He was in San Quentin.

00:52:07.720 --> 00:52:09.300
After he came out, we gave him a job.

00:52:10.040 --> 00:52:10.560
I see.

00:52:11.760 --> 00:52:12.680
Yeah, it adds up.

00:52:13.780 --> 00:52:16.460
Meet Inspector walks in at the wrong time, so he's pushed into a saw.

