00:55:25.720 --> 00:55:26.900
Profitable little enterprise.

00:55:32.050 --> 00:55:34.350
What's the matter with you?

00:55:36.120 --> 00:55:36.700
What are you doing?

00:55:38.680 --> 00:55:39.840
Look, Freddy, you need me.

00:55:42.260 --> 00:55:43.320
You're not gonna get away with it.

00:55:44.770 --> 00:55:45.810
Sure, I need you.

00:55:46.180 --> 00:55:47.440
And you're going to help me.

00:55:48.420 --> 00:55:51.880
I've already told Gene I suspect you, and here you are.

00:55:53.040 --> 00:55:53.820
Good red-handed.

00:55:53.960 --> 00:55:54.760
Freddy, you can trust me.

00:55:54.760 --> 00:55:55.640
