01:01:34.470 --> 01:01:52.900
Well, goodbye, you two.

01:01:53.530 --> 01:01:55.710
By the way, where's this honeymoon taking you?

01:01:55.960 --> 01:01:57.780
Well, I sort of hoped we'd be going to Honolulu,

01:01:57.960 --> 01:01:59.500
